<title>JAPAN: TIFFE key Dec euroyen futures fall 0.1 to 98.82.</title>
<headline>TIFFE key Dec euroyen futures fall 0.1 to 98.82.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Key December euroyen deposit rate futures on TIFFE fell 0.1 to 98.82 in early trade on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
